To add new projects and photos.

0. Upload your photo to the public folder
1. Go to the correct page under the pages folder.
2. Update the JSON with the the name of the file with a forward slash first.
3. Update the links

To update the github repo for AI research go to the file "AboutMeAndNavigation" and find the text 

href="https://github.com/Phissie/MYAIRESEARCH"

and replace with the name of your repo. :)